sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Consumer tests (quotes)
    participant M as Pact mock server
    participant B as Pact broker
    participant P as Provider build (rate service)
    C->>M: GET /rates/WIDGET?currency=USD
    M-->>C: canned response defined in the test
    C->>B: publish contract (pact file)
    P->>B: fetch contracts from all consumers
    P->>P: replay each request against the real provider
    P->>B: publish verification result
    Note over C,P: can-i-deploy asks the broker before either side ships
